nt Integrations†github.com L19: \nL20: [Button: On this page]\nL21: # Your First API Call\nL22: \nL23: The DeepSeek API uses an API format compatible with OpenAI/Anthropic. By modifying the configuration, you can use the OpenAI/Anthropic SDK or softwares compatible with the OpenAI/Anthropic API to access the DeepSeek API.\nL24: \nL25: PARAM  | VALUE\nL26: --- | ---\nL27: base_url (OpenAI)  | `https://api.deepseek.com`\nL28: base_url (Anthropic)  | `https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic`\nL29: api_key  | apply for an cite16†API key†platform.deepseek.com L30: model  | `deepseek-flash`^{(1)}\nL31: `deepseek-v4-pro`\nL32: (1) Use `deepseek-flash` as the model name. The legacy names `deepseek-v4-flash` and `deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp` are still accepted, but the corresponding models have been retired, their requests are served by the DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash model and billed at the Flash price.\nL33: ## Integrate with Agent Toolscite17†​ L34: \nL35: DeepSeek Harness is now in developer preview for agent harness developers worldwide. See the cite6†DeepSeek Harness Guide†deepseek-harness.github.io for details.\nL36: \nL37: The DeepSeek API is supported by many popular AI agent and coding assistant tools. If you use tools like Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, or OpenCode, you can use DeepSeek as the backend model directly — no code required.\nL38: \nL39: See the cite7†Agent Integrations Guide for details.\nL40: ## Invoke The Chat APIcite18†​ L41: \nL42: Once you have obtained an API key, you can access the DeepSeek model using the following example scripts in the OpenAI API format. This is a non-stream example, you can set the `stream` parameter to `true` to get stream response.\nL43: \nL44: For examples using the Anthropic API format, please refer to cite19†Anthropic API .\nL45:   * curl\nL46:   * python\nL47:   * nodejs\nL48: \nL49:     `curl https://api.deepseek.com/chat/completions \\\nL50:       -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\nL51:       -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${DEEPSEEK_API_KEY}\" \\\nL52:       -d '{\nL53:             \"model\": \"deepseek-flash\",\nL54:             \"messages\": [\nL55:               {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"You are a helpful assistant.\"},\nL56:               {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello!\"}\nL57:             ],\nL58:             \"thinking\": {\"type\": \"enabled\"},\nL59:             \"reasoning_effort\": \"high\",\nL60:             \"stream\": false\nL61:           }'\nL62:     `\nL63: \nL64:     `# Please install OpenAI SDK first: `pip3 install openai`\nL65:     import os\nL66:     from openai import OpenAI\nL67:     client = OpenAI(\nL68:         api_key=os.environ.get('DEEPSEEK_API_KEY'),\nL69:         base_url=\"https://api.deepseek.com\")\nL70:     response = client.chat.completions.create(\nL71:         model=\"deepseek-flash\",\nL72:         messages=[\nL73:             {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"You are a helpful assistant\"},\nL74:             {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello\"},\nL75:         ],\nL76:         stream=False,\nL77:         reasoning_effort=\"high\",\nL78:         extra_body={\"thinking\": {\"type\": \"enabled\"}}\nL79:     )\nL80:     print(response.choices[0].message.content)\nL81:     `\nL82: \nL83:     `// Please install OpenAI SDK first: `npm install openai`\nL84:     import OpenAI from \"openai\";\nL85:     const openai = new OpenAI({\nL86:             baseURL: 'https://api.deepseek.com',\nL87:             apiKey: process.env.DEEPSEEK_API_KEY,\nL88:     });\nL89:     async function main() {\nL90:       const completion = await openai.chat.completions.create({\nL91:         messages: [{ role: \"system\", content: \"You are a helpful assistant.\" }],\nL92:         model: \"deepseek-flash\",\nL93:         thinking: {\"type\": \"enabled\"},\nL94:         reasoning_effort: \"high\",\nL95:         stream: false,\nL96:       });\nL97:       console.log(completion.choices[0].message.content);\nL98:     }\nL99:     main();\nL100:     `\nL101: cite2†Next Models & Pricing L102: \nL103:   * cite17†Integrate with Agent Tools L104:   * cite18†Invoke The Chat API L105: \nL106: WeChat Official Account\nL107: \nL108:   * cite20†Image: WeChat QRcode†cdn.deepseek.com L109: \nL110: Community\nL111: \nL112:   * Email (api-service@deepseek.com)\nL113:   * cite21†Discord†discord.gg L114:   * cite22†Twitter†twitter.com L115: \nL116: More\nL117: \nL118:   * cite23†GitHub†github.com L119: \nL120: Copyright © 2026 DeepSeek, Inc.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn29468view3 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://platform.kimi.com/blog/changelog\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 1\nL0: URL https://platform.kimi.com/blog/changelog is not accessible via this tool.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMiniMax 研究 - 技术分享与产品洞察 | MiniMax (https://www.minimaxi.com/blog)\nciteturn29468view4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.minimaxi.com/blog\",\"lineno\":null}); Redirected to URL: https://www.minimax.cn/blog; Total lines: 68\nL0: 模型\nL1: \nL2: cite0†Image: 语言模型 语言模型\nL3: \nL4: cite1†MiniMax M3 cite2†MiniMax M2.7 cite3†MiniMax M2.5 L5: \nL6: cite4†Image: 视频生成 视频生成\nL7: \nL8: cite5†MiniMax H3 L9: \nL10: cite6†Image: 语音&音乐 语音&音乐\nL11: \nL12: cite7†MiniMax Speech 2.8 cite8†MiniMax Music 3.0 L13: \nL14: 产品\nL15: \nL16: cite9†MiniMax Code†agent.minimax.cn cite10†MiniMax Design†design.minimax.cn cite11†语音 cite12†星野†www.xingyeai.com L17: \nL18: API\nL19: \nL20: 订阅\nL21: \nL22: 研究\nL23: \nL24: 关于我们\nL25: \nL26: cite13†Image: 与所有人共创智能 与所有人共创智能\nL27: \nL28: cite14†公司介绍 cite15†新闻 cite16†投资者关系†ir.minimax.cn cite17†加入我们 L29: \nL30: cite18†EN†www.minimax.io L31: \nL32: [Input]\nL33: \nL34: 模型\nL35: \nL36: cite0†Image: 语言模型 语言模型\nL37: \nL38: c